I consider it now feature complete, with all features working and a lot of bugfixes. The settings section has been massively overhauled and I'd say it's close to final.

For development ease, I also had to give in and lowercase the. It now follows the file/folder structure almost exactly, to the point you can almost always add .tid to the end of a file and have it reachable. I can't actually attach the source code here but it's a little early either way.